    "verdict_notes": "The Appendix C table is flattened in the text. The 12 value rows alternate learnable (100%) and modified (low) forms, three pairs per modulus. The reader's mapping scrambles r9–r12 and creates duplicates (r14 duplicates r18; r20 duplicates r11). Polynomial expressions also appear misrendered: exponents belong outside the parentheses, e.g. (4n1+n2^2)^3. The Appendix C rows give endpoints only, so they are set to 'none' rather than V1. Grokking evidence is caption wording on single runs with no quantified delay."
